7,0 $ Basidiomata  cupulate,  dorsally  attached,  stipe  absent,  hymenophore  delimited  by  a  sterile margin. Spores ellipsoidal to oval, Q=1.6. Usually on pleurocarpous mosses $ A. retiruga (Bull.) Redhead
